      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "This lesson covers formal commands (usted/ustedes) for regular verbs. The stem vowel changes from -ar to -e (and -er/-ir to -a) and endings -e/-en or -a/-an are added. Negative commands place *no* before the verb."
